And so that's what they used.

460
00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:07.260
Yes, these trainers were so great with the cats.

461
00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:12.020
And obviously, honey isn't going to do anything, you know, that's just, like, organic.

462
00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:14.940
I do have amazing memories of this scene.

