00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:23.580
Well, you can see it in the episode.

465
00:23:23.780 --> 00:23:26.420
Like, every shot, the cat is in a different position.

466
00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:28.820
It kept jumping out of his arMs.

467
00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:40.360
And so we really had to sort of deliver the emotion of the scene but get our lines out quickly because this thing was climbing off Rain and wanted to go exploring the whole scene.

468
00:23:42.180 --> 00:23:47.420
Well, my favorite is the shot where it's, like, clearly crawling over his shoulder.

